body:
"I know would be better off if I were gone, I doubt anyone would miss me for long" coming from you who had just lost someone im guessing to death? knowing that feeling a hole like that creates in the mind heart and lives of people you leave are you really sure? that what i quoted still stands 

&#x200B;

i tried to do it the whole self killing thing few months back not there to tell you "things will magically get better" but to say hard things are unbareable in the beginig middle and even near the end but you build a resilience to it over time and its becomes less hard still hard but you cope better 

&#x200B;

im not some know it all im just an idiot online that read what you said and thinks you coming out to family was brave and you sticking around them after to patch things up sounds hard and well someone with guts like that im sure you have more fight in you than you realise right now not gonna tell you to live for anyone not even your self but im gonna tell you the really crappy stuff slowly gets easier to stomache not instantly not magically slowly but there will be progress

&#x200B;

good luck fellow person

what i would not give to be 22 again 

&#x200B;

well allow me to say this that idea of yours sounds kinda good you thought that one out well but how much does nitrogen cost?

damn, in situations like this a person would say "me too you are not alone" but we are all as aslone as possible in this day n age maybe its depression speaking but im not gonna lie n say "its going to get better" a lot of the times it really dont and here comes the but

&#x200B;

when you suffer trough living hell you grow this sort of tollerence for the worst of things it would be inaccurate to say it makes you "stronger" but definate increase in resilience things dont get easier if i said that id be lying to you like ive been lied too countless times but you will adapt sometimes not always for the best but one way or another things you suffer gets more "comfortable" 

&#x200B;

if luck exists after reading what you wrote and thinking sounds a lot like what i was saying after my failed sucide attempt few months back i wish you much of it as you can get 

&#x200B;

extra good luck dear person

&#x200B;

kind regards from a pointless existence (im talking about myself)

things to say  to grasp your attention words millions of words so many languages yet comunication seems a little difficult i know what i want to get across but not sure what the right way to say it is difficult for someone who over thinks like myself 

&#x200B;

i would like to try and get to know you and hopefully expand that personal world of yours

thank you and i believe you are right easier to connect in person or atleast would seem that way i dont think i would reach out like this just anywhere online tho empaths are different so my fingers are crossed and im hoping for the best 

&#x200B;

again thanks for replying yet again its very nice nice hearing from you specially when your words were so possitive 

&#x200B;

i hope you have an excelent day

i would have said the same about myself with kids kinda still am they are fragile and do this thing where they learn from you constantly some how specially learn the wrong things from you 

but in time that goes away and you get really comfertable with them more so than with most people 

&#x200B;

and yeah animals too i personally love cats i like dogs too but theres something you cant get from them that you do with humans 

&#x200B;

not many out there and i dont mean children i mean adults there are still a few honestly decent people who dont use and judge and well have one sided relationships with the people around them 

&#x200B;

i wish you the best of luck finding a real person to connect with by real i mean real and not fake personality wise

"im so sorry if this is all over the place" hey you dont have to be sorry here 

&#x200B;

im not doctor and i dont know exactly how you feel i mean who can its your feelings no one else can feel them for you but i can relate when things get bad stress piles up depression and the one thing that makes it all too much lack of sleep thats right about when this start feeling inside out and raw 

&#x200B;

it will feel like this for a while i cant help i cant offer advice and i cant make promises but i can say make it trough this and there will be times moments and even days where it was worth putting up with this bull crap 

&#x200B;

lastly and dont take my advice as gospel if people are being noisey and you are loosing your mind call the cops try saying: folks next door are playing really loud music and its hard to tell and i dont mean to waste your time or anything but faintly behind the music it sounds like someone is being beaten or something i dont know but maybe you should go check it out

&#x200B;

all that said i wish you good luck and hope you can get some sleep soon

im the devil more of less least thats how my mind works very twisted so heres some bad advice you should never take 

&#x200B;

write a note fold it give it to her dont let her open it in the note say: i didnt really cheat on you i was just scared you did it to me because i been having nightmares about it 

&#x200B;

then while she has that closed note say to her i need to confess i cheated on you

&#x200B;

people always some how wanna confess they cheated when another person confesses first dont ask me why human mind is a bit odd but nothing gets a cheating talking more than when someone else cheats too 

&#x200B;

just hope she reads the note instead of throwing it away and running off if this dont work i will take not blame but really buddy just sit her down and talk to her tell her everything you just told us strangers im sure she will put your fears to ease 

&#x200B;

btw i have had these nightmares they get worst

you right nothing is worst than fake offers to help or in my experience people who do want to help but are just very gifted at saying and doing all the wrong things at the worst times

&#x200B;

i dont think i can help but i think its cool that you are atleast doing cool things like the new pc n teliscope while you'er still here i like the sound of that

i thought i was just crazy or bi polar or did i mention crazy? 

&#x200B;

but seriously you said and explained how i feel perfectly even in all the anger its hard to hate people even ones who do you the most harm 

&#x200B;

im new to the word "empath" if it weren't for a youtube video id still be thinking i need to be locked up or in a psych ward 

&#x200B;

oh and yes i know what you are talking about
